---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Disclaimer",
  "url": "https://megalancer.online/disclaimer/"
};
---

<Page
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Disclaimer for MegaLancer financial, health, legal, tax, and calculator content. Learn the limits of our tools and when to consult a professional."
  canonicalUrl="https://megalancer.online/disclaimer/"
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="policy-page">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

    <h2>Financial tools</h2>
    <p>Calculators on this site use standard financial formulas and publicly available tax data. Results are estimates for planning purposes only. Tax situations vary. Consult a CPA or tax professional for advice specific to your situation. Tax data sourced from IRS.gov and state revenue departments.</p>

    <h2>Health calculators</h2>
    <p>BMI, TDEE, calorie, and other health calculators on this site follow formulas established by the WHO and peer-reviewed nutritional science. They are screening tools, not diagnostic instruments. Consult a healthcare provider before making health decisions.</p>

    <h2>Legal document generators</h2>
    <p>Documents generated by this site are templates based on general legal principles. They are not reviewed by an attorney for your jurisdiction. Laws vary by state and country. Have important contracts reviewed by a licensed attorney before signing.</p>

    <h2>Accuracy and updates</h2>
    <p>We update formulas and data when regulations change. If you find an error, please contact us. Tax brackets are updated annually in January.</p>
  </article>
</Page>
